			"date": "2024-07-05T15:02:14.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> is `fantasy` not an option?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112734506741274468",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/112734506741274468",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-05T15:07:38.429Z",
			"content": "<p>for this to happen without breaking the web they’d need to use a sans-serif metric-compatible version of `serif` (`sans-serif` is not this)</p><p><a href=\"https://codepen.io/zachleat/pen/MWMgBNj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">codepen.io/zachleat/pen/MWMgBNj</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112734510543721196",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@rauschma/112734510472673319",
			"author": {
				"name": "Axel Rauschmayer",
				"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@rauschma",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/291/906/591/238/009/original/76fd351b6f7a848e.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-05T15:08:35.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I much prefer serif fonts. I find them easier to read (Al vs. AI etc.) and we now have high-resolution displays everywhere so that they always look good.</p><p>My impression is that sans-serif fonts were a trend a while ago but that seems to be changing.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112734513444707173",
			"parentId": "112734485693145328",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/112734513444707173",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-05T15:09:20.716Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://carhenge.club/@mattdsteele\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>mattdsteele</span></a></span> `fantasy` is a collective hallucination, like the american dream or a fast react web site</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112734514256637540",
			"parentId": "112734506741274468",
