			},
			"date": "2024-07-05T15:14:35.525Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@chriskirknielsen\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>chriskirknielsen</span></a></span> hah! Countercounterpoint your CSS is never borked if you use serif</p>",
