			"date": "2024-07-05T15:34:24.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Why wait? You can make your default font MS Comic Sans now!</p><p>(This also means: If any websites break when a browser changes the default fallback font, they are already broken for any users who are fussy about typography.)</p>",
