			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> That would already be a lot. Also in most browsers this seems to potentially be a user choice... 😬 <br>I'd now like to revise my answer from 0% to 100%. 😂</p>",
