			"date": "2024-07-05T16:22:51.491Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@jsit\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jsit</span></a></span> for the record I would vote 100%—just a curious poll to see what other folks think 😅</p>",
